(7739687, 1276462, 122678, '<td valign="top">My top pick for this challenge</td>', 'My top pick for this challenge', '2023-03-07 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739688, 1276331, 122678, '<td valign="top">Very delicate and beautiful</td>', 'Very delicate and beautiful', '2023-03-07 12:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739699, 1276462, 75585, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS! Great foreground, beautiful colors/saturation. Personally I wish the last bit of the tree tops on the left were  not there, but that is so nit picky but I would have liked the balance better without them.  This one is definitely top 3 for me!  &lt;not voting yet&gt;</td>', 'I LOVE THIS! Great foreground, beautiful colors/saturation. Personally I wish the last bit of the tree tops on the left were  not there, but that is so nit picky but I would have liked the balance better without them.  This one is definitely top 3 for me!  <not voting yet>', '2023-03-07 14:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739700, 1276287, 75585, '<td valign="top">Great idea - love that the snow is undisturbed!  Good find!!</td>', 'Great idea - love that the snow is undisturbed!  Good find!!', '2023-03-07 14:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739701, 1276331, 75585, '<td valign="top">I really like this one . . . Personally I dont think I would have centered that limb, I think having it come in from the right upper corner might have been a bit more pleasing as opposed to centered, but either way it is still stunning.  I think itll do very well for you!  &lt;not voting yet&gt;</td>', 'I really like this one . . . Personally I dont think I would have centered that limb, I think having it come in from the right upper corner might have been a bit more pleasing as opposed to centered, but either way it is still stunning.  I think itll do very well for you!  <not voting yet>', '2023-03-07 14:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739972, 1276479, 42733, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.', '2023-03-12 12:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739973, 1276490, 42733, '<td valign="top">My pick for red in this challenge.</td>', 'My pick for red in this challenge.', '2023-03-12 12:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739974, 1276345, 42733, '<td valign="top">My pick for yellow in this challenge.</td>', 'My pick for yellow in this challenge.', '2023-03-12 12:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739975, 1276331, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top four for this challenge.</td>', 'In my top four for this challenge.', '2023-03-12 13:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739992, 1276483, 173844, '<td valign="top">There are degrees of immensity, and here the mountains are pressed down by the clouds, like a delicate flower.  They''re mostly dark, acceding to another''s power.  How the scene is beautifully lit allows us to come in as the curtain is being raised, so sit back, watch, feel and learn.  Here are the moments of anticipation.  The whole play is extraordinary, the swollen orange clouds, the heaviness of atmosphere, the immanence.  Thanks for the front row seat.<br/>One of three personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'There are degrees of immensity, and here the mountains are pressed down by the clouds, like a delicate flower.  They''re mostly dark, acceding to another''s power.  How the scene is beautifully lit allows us to come in as the curtain is being raised, so sit back, watch, feel and learn.  Here are the moments of anticipation.  The whole play is extraordinary, the swollen orange clouds, the heaviness of atmosphere, the immanence.  Thanks for the front row seat.One of three personal favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-12 21:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739993, 1276484, 173844, '<td valign="top">You can see these people''s exhiliration at the drama of the water drop over a fire.  It''s nicely caught and portrayed.  It''s a heroic moment, reason to cheer.  Look a bit deeper and see that the city is at odds with nature, being dry scrubland.  Someone knock that guy off the soapbox, will ya.  I like how the people are backed by the great expanse of the city; it''s shown to be personal.  Nice composition.<br/>One of three personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'You can see these people''s exhiliration at the drama of the water drop over a fire.  It''s nicely caught and portrayed.  It''s a heroic moment, reason to cheer.  Look a bit deeper and see that the city is at odds with nature, being dry scrubland.  Someone knock that guy off the soapbox, will ya.  I like how the people are backed by the great expanse of the city; it''s shown to be personal.  Nice composition.One of three personal favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-12 22:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739994, 1276494, 173844, '<td valign="top">Love the focus here, sharp on the incidental tree branches and blurred elsewhere.  It deeply conveys the unsettling atmosphere, the uncertainty, the dissolution of sunshine and blue, calm skies.  Is the rain already falling, it''s ambiguous.  It''s confusing and a bit disorienting.  So rightly and elegantly expressed.  The palette helps to experience the mood.  Very fine.<br/>One of three personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Love the focus here, sharp on the incidental tree branches and blurred elsewhere.  It deeply conveys the unsettling atmosphere, the uncertainty, the dissolution of sunshine and blue, calm skies.  Is the rain already falling, it''s ambiguous.  It''s confusing and a bit disorienting.  So rightly and elegantly expressed.  The palette helps to experience the mood.  Very fine.One of three personal favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-12 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7739997, 1276362, 138630, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this is really low!  I gave this an 8 and Barbara''s a 9 - no 10''s.  I love this and think it fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'Whoa, this is really low!  I gave this an 8 and Barbara''s a 9 - no 10''s.  I love this and think it fits the challenge very well.', '2023-03-13 00:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
