(7740111, 1276362, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image does merit more than the 6 I gave it.  It slides easily and becomingly into the abstract.  As for its intended take on the challenge, the raindrops all across the window feel like a dissolution of the weather, etc..  I also like the title take on the song, "Oh Happy Day."</td>', 'This image does merit more than the 6 I gave it.  It slides easily and becomingly into the abstract.  As for its intended take on the challenge, the raindrops all across the window feel like a dissolution of the weather, etc..  I also like the title take on the song, "Oh Happy Day."', '2023-03-14 15:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740339, 1276420, 83313, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but noticed this on the front page. I was curious how wide a lens you used, as I have also submitted a photo or two from an airline seat and had to go very wide. I recently bought that 12-100 myself. Even used, it is the most expensive lens I have purchased. I hadn''t thought the manual focus clutch would be a big deal, but it really came in handy in diminishing evening light when the camera could not easily lock focus.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but noticed this on the front page. I was curious how wide a lens you used, as I have also submitted a photo or two from an airline seat and had to go very wide. I recently bought that 12-100 myself. Even used, it is the most expensive lens I have purchased. I hadn''t thought the manual focus clutch would be a big deal, but it really came in handy in diminishing evening light when the camera could not easily lock focus.', '2023-03-17 10:33:15.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
